        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SKY100FBR, Square Acrylic Offset Door Handle with Brass Brackets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sky 100 Offset  Acrylic Door Pull features offset mounts made from brass. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from frosted or clear acrylic. The First Impressions Sky Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sky Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SKY100FBR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262416\"><b>First Impressions SKY100FBR Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>FII-SKY100012FBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SKY100024FBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SKY100036FBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SKY100048FBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SKY100060FBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sky Square Acrylic Pull Square with Brass Offset Mounts",
                "description": "The Sky 100 Offset  Acrylic Door Pull features offset mounts made from brass. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from frosted or clear acrylic. The First Impressions Sky Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Square Acrylic Offset Door Handle with Brass Brackets, Sky Square Acrylic Pull Square with Brass Offset Mounts, Sky Offset Acrylic Door Pull Brass Brackets, FII-SKY03, clear Acrylic Door Pulls, First Impressions SKY100FBR, FII-SKY100FBR, First Impressions sky 100,"
